OL,3,ASunbed firms must not downplay cancer
OL,4,Arisk, says watchdog
OL,5,
OL,6,FA watchdog has launched a crackdown on
OL,7,Fmisleading sunbed adverts, warning
OL,8,Ftanning firms they must not claim their
OL,9,Fbeds are safe or can treat medical
OL,10,Fconditions.
OL,12,FThe Committee for Advertising Practice
OL,13,F(CAP) said it was issuing a UK-wide
OL,14,Fenforcement notice to "send a clear
OL,15,Fmessage to the industry that
OL,16,Fadvertisers must not downplay the risks
OL,17,Fassociated with sunbed use".
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
