OL,3,ASunbed firms must not downplay cancer
OL,4,Arisk, says watchdog
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier this year, the BBC identified
OL,7,Fhundreds of social media videos
OL,8,Fclaiming the beds could boost energy
OL,9,Fand treat skin conditions or mental
OL,10,Fhealth problems.
OL,12,FThe Sunbed Association, which
OL,13,Frepresents around half of the UK's
OL,14,Ftanning salons, said it fully supported
OL,15,Faction against misleading adverts, but
OL,16,Fsaid businesses must still be allowed
OL,17,Fto demonstrate they operate
OL,18,Fresponsibly.
